' i/emp.quests: a module of Empire 6.0 (i.empire), from the Image 1.2
' version's +.emp6.quests (games/empire6/plus_emp6_quests.lbl)
' Jumps to i.empire's lines are written {$33}nnn (the line 3nnn, its first
' digit a raw byte), which C64List 4.04 leaves as it is: it can't name a line
' outside the file, as 3.03 could (1.2's {uses:includes.lbl}). Their names:
' emp6-includes.lbl
{alpha:alt}
{uses:..\3_0-preface.lbl}
{number:4000}
	+.emp6.quests - written by pinacolada
	print "Quests not finished yet.":return
{number:4199}
	+.emp6.quests - written by pinacolada
